{
  "recipe_id": "list-statement-lines",
  "chat_exposed": false,
  "version": 1,
  "ttl": 0,
  "metadata": {
    "name": "List statement lines",
    "description": "Use “List statement lines” in Recued. Shows imported statement lines, most recently imported first, for one account or across all of them, with the net for the page.",
    "author": "recued-core",
    "supported_platforms": [],
    "recipe_bundle": "recued-core/statement-import",
    "tags": [
      "pack:statement-import",
      "banking",
      "records",
      "read"
    ],
    "budget_ms": 30000,
    "readme": "Leave the account blank to see every account at once. The net is the sum of the lines SHOWN, not the account balance — raise the limit or filter by account before reading anything into it.\n\n## The order is import order, not date order\n\nYour bank's date is stored exactly as it wrote it, and text like `20-Aug-2020` does not sort into date order — December would land before August. Recued will not guess your bank's date format, because a wrong guess silently reorders your statement. Lines come back most-recently-imported first, which within one import is the order your file listed them. To pick a day, filter on it.\n\n## Why there are three money columns\n\nRecued stores your statement the way your bank printed it. A bank that prints one signed column fills **Amount**; a bank that prints a pair fills **In** and **Out**. Nothing is folded together on the way in, because which column means money out is a fact about your bank — a stored line you can check against the paper is worth more than a tidier table. The net combines all three here, at reading time, where it is easy to check and easy to change."
  },
  "depends_on": [
    "recued-core.statement-import"
  ],
  "variables": {
    "account_label": {
      "label": "Account (blank = all accounts)",
      "type": "string",
      "default": ""
    },
    "limit": {
      "label": "How many lines to show",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 100
    }
  },
  "requires": [],
  "prefetch_steps": [],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "acct",
      "transform": "trim",
      "input": "{{config.account_label}}"
    },
    {
      "id": "scoped",
      "transform": "compare",
      "left": "{{step.acct}}",
      "operator": "is_not_empty"
    },
    {
      "id": "all_lines",
      "op": "recued-core.statement-import.line.search",
      "args": {
        "sort": "-_record.created_at",
        "limit": "{{config.limit}}"
      },
      "skip_when": "{{step.scoped}} equal true"
    },
    {
      "id": "account_lines",
      "op": "recued-core.statement-import.line.search",
      "args": {
        "filters": {
          "account_label": "{{step.acct}}"
        },
        "sort": "-_record.created_at",
        "limit": "{{config.limit}}"
      },
      "skip_when": "{{step.scoped}} equal false"
    },
    {
      "id": "lines",
      "transform": "coalesce",
      "values": [
        "{{step.account_lines.records}}",
        "{{step.all_lines.records}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "shown",
      "transform": "count",
      "input": "{{step.lines}}"
    },
    {
      "id": "net_signed",
      "transform": "sum",
      "array": "{{step.lines}}",
      "field": "amount"
    },
    {
      "id": "net_in",
      "transform": "sum",
      "array": "{{step.lines}}",
      "field": "money_in"
    },
    {
      "id": "net_out",
      "transform": "sum",
      "array": "{{step.lines}}",
      "field": "money_out"
    },
    {
      "id": "net",
      "transform": "math",
      "expression": "{{step.net_signed}} + {{step.net_in}} - {{step.net_out}}"
    },
    {
      "id": "table",
      "transform": "to_table",
      "array": "{{step.lines}}",
      "columns": [
        {
          "field": "posted_on",
          "label": "Date (as your bank wrote it)"
        },
        {
          "field": "description",
          "label": "Description"
        },
        {
          "field": "amount",
          "label": "Amount"
        },
        {
          "field": "money_in",
          "label": "In"
        },
        {
          "field": "money_out",
          "label": "Out"
        },
        {
          "field": "currency",
          "label": "Currency"
        },
        {
          "field": "account_label",
          "label": "Account"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card",
      "transform": "to_summary",
      "fields": [
        {
          "label": "Lines",
          "value": "{{step.shown}}"
        },
        {
          "label": "Net",
          "value": "{{step.net:currency}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "output": {
    "render": [
      {
        "type": "summary",
        "source": "step.card"
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "source": "step.table"
      }
    ]
  }
}
